---
description: Entry point for the Riverpod template instruction set
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root, then `lib/AGENTS.md` for feature work.

Canonical coding rules live in `.claude/rules/*.md` and that is their only copy. Read the files
whose `paths:` match files you are about to touch.

The sibling files in this directory are pointers, not rules. Each carries `globs:` corresponding
to its canonical rule's `paths:` so Cursor attaches the right pointer without duplicating policy.
